{
	"id": "reduckAiOverview",
	"name": "Google AI Overview, on a webhook (Reduck)",
	"nodes": [
		{
			"parameters": {
				"content": "## Google AI Overview, on a webhook\n\nCall `GET /webhook/ai-overview?q=<search>` and get the AI Overview Google shows for that search as JSON: its answer as Markdown and the pages it cites.\n\nThe Reduck node runs the script `reduck/google.com/get_ai_overview` on a Reduck managed browser in the US (**Region**: US East). The site needs no sign-in, so you install nothing.\n\nWhen the run fails, the answer is the run with its `error`: the node's **On Error** setting is **Continue**.\n\nThe Reduck node uses the credential `reduckQuickStart`: the README's quick start makes it from your API key.",
				"height": 340,
				"width": 420
			},
			"id": "4d0f3a8e-6a51-4c1b-9d0e-2a7c1f5b8e11",
			"name": "About",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [-460, -160]
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"path": "ai-overview",
				"responseMode": "lastNode",
				"options": {}
			},
			"id": "8b2e6c41-0f7d-4e3a-b5a9-6d1c2e4f7a12",
			"name": "Webhook",
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
			"typeVersion": 2,
			"position": [0, 0],
			"webhookId": "5e9a1c7d-3b2f-4a6e-8d0c-1f4b7e2a9c13"
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"authentication": "apiKey",
				"script": {
					"__rl": true,
					"mode": "address",
					"value": "reduck/google.com/get_ai_overview"
				},
				"args": {
					"mappingMode": "defineBelow",
					"value": {
						"query": "={{ $json.query.q }}"
					},
